.TH geectl-remote-search-projects 1  "geectl-remote-search-projects 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-search\-projects \- Search projects by name. Substring matches on name, title, and description by default; `\-\-exact` keeps only exact\-name matches (the filter runs client\-side)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote search\-projects\fR [\fB\-\-exact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITERM\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search projects by name. Substring matches on name, title, and description by default; `\-\-exact` keeps only exact\-name matches (the filter runs client\-side)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-exact\fR
Only show projects whose name is exactly the term
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITERM\fR>
The search term
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
